    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d428">

                <pb facs="0319" n="247" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg247"/>

                <head>Inhabitants of Kingston, Jamaica</head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kingston, Jamaica</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1865-06-05">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 5, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">Andrew
                    Johnson</hi>, <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President of the United States of America:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>May it please your excellency: By desire of a numerous meeting of the inhabitants
                    of this city, held at the Tabernacle on the 1st instant, in condolence on the
                    assassination of your late beloved President, I have the honor to hand herewith
                    a copy of resolutions and address which were unanimously adopted, and also to
                    state that the sympathies of the people of Jamaica have ever been with your
                    government. I have further to ask the condescension of your excellency towards
                    the meeting, by placing the enclosed letters in possession of Mrs. Lincoln and
                    the honorable W. H. Seward, giving expression to our sincere and respectful
                    wishes.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest respect, your excellency’s most obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GEORGE W. GORDON,</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chairman</hi>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
